  "description": {
    "text": "Lillie's Support Box (莉莉艾的声援专属礼盒) was the first gift box of the Simplified Chinese Pokémon Trading Card Game, released on 11 November 2022, two weeks after the game's launch. It held five holo cards, the Supporter Lillie, Solgaleo GX, Lunala GX, Cosmog and Cosmoem, with a Lillie display frame, two Sun & Moon playmats, sleeves and deck boxes, and six 25-card Storming Emergence packs, two each of Radiant, Verdant and Abundant. Its Lillie, Solgaleo GX and Lunala GX have different art from their booster pack cards.\n\nOn Pokémon's Tmall store only members could buy it, one box each, and demand outran supply: on release day Pokémon announced it would make more. The reprinted box went on sale again on 26 April 2023, by lottery on the Tmall store and in shops.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: Lillie's Support Box, the first Simplified Chinese gift box (3 November 2022)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/16365.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: Lillie's Support Box goes on sale (11 November 2022)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/16363.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: Lillie's Support Box to be produced and sold again (11 November 2022)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/16362.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: Lillie's Support Box on sale again (17 February 2023)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/16324.html"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A \"CSMLC\" mark at the bottom left, and a number out of 005",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: Lillie's Support Box, the first Simplified Chinese gift box (3 November 2022)",
